        },
        {
          "text": "Te ma azi emi tia, adripi, emi ma a’i e’yo asi omizani ’dori, te ma si waraga emi dri e’yo weresi ’do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.22",
